    <title>Links of Interest</title>
    <ul>
        <li>
            <p>
                <url href="https://www.census.gov/topics/public-sector/congressional-apportionment/about.html">About Congressional Apportionment</url> from the U.S. Census Bureau.
            </p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p>
                <url href="https://www.census.gov/topics/public-sector/congressional-apportionment/about/computing.html">Computing Apportionment</url> from the U.S. Census Bureau.
            </p>
        </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        Note that the public availability of U.S. Census data is important for anyone who wants to see how different apportionment methods would work out!
    </p>
</subsection>

